@startuml
title EcoBrief Bolivia - Web Scraping simplificado

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #16a34a
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #1e3a5f
  FontColor #334155
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #16a34a
  FontColor #334155
}

rectangle "config/sources.yaml\nfuentes + selectores CSS" as config
rectangle "httpx\ndescarga HTML" as httpx
rectangle "BeautifulSoup\nparseo y selectores" as bs4
rectangle "lxml\nparser HTML" as lxml
rectangle "Fallback generico\nextrae enlaces y filtra\narticulos periodisticos" as fallback
rectangle "Noticias recolectadas\narticulos normalizados" as output

config --> httpx : fuentes configuradas
httpx --> bs4 : HTML descargado
bs4 --> lxml : parseo rapido
bs4 --> fallback : si el selector no coincide
fallback --> output
bs4 --> output : si el selector coincide

note right of config
Cada fuente define:
- selector de articulo
- titulo
- URL
- fecha
- imagen
- cuerpo
end note

note bottom of fallback
Permite seguir recolectando
aunque cambie la estructura HTML.
end note

@enduml
